@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix : <http://example.org/ontology#>.

### Classes ###
:Vehicle a owl:Class.
:VehicleType a owl:Class.
:Color a owl:Class.
:EngineSize a owl:Class.
:MaxSpeed a owl:Class.
:DomainExpert a owl:Class.
:Stakeholder a owl:Class.
:Requirement a owl:Class.
:Person a owl:Class.
:Affiliation a owl:Class.
:Project a owl:Class.
:Skill a owl:Class.
:Experience a owl:Class.
:Author a owl:Class.
:Title a owl:Class.
:Topic a owl:Class.
:Animal a owl:Class.
:AnimalType a owl:Class.
:Zoo a owl:Class.

### Object Properties ###
:hasType a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasColor a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasEngineSize a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasMaxSpeed a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasName a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasRole a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasAffiliation a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasProject a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasSkill a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasExperience a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasAuthor a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasTitle a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasTopic a owl:ObjectProperty.

### Datatype Properties ###
:Name a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Description a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Domain a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Concepts a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Relationships a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Classes a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Instances a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Expertise a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:ContactInfo a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Priority a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Status a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Version a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Scalability a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Flexibility a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Modularity a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Changes a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Evolution a owl:DatatypeProperty.

### Individuals ###
:Vehicle rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasType :VehicleType;
    :hasColor :Color;
    :hasEngineSize :EngineSize;
    :hasMaxSpeed :MaxSpeed.

:DomainExpert rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasName :Name;
    :Expertise :Expertise;
    :ContactInfo :ContactInfo.

:Stakeholder rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasName :Name;
    :Role :Role;
    :ContactInfo :ContactInfo.

:Requirement rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :Description :Description;
    :Priority :Priority;
    :Status :Status.

:Person rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasName :Name;
    :hasRole :Role;
    :hasAffiliation :Affiliation;
    :hasProject :Project;
    :hasSkill :Skill;
    :hasExperience :Experience;
    :hasAuthor :Author;
    :hasTitle :Title;
    :hasTopic :Topic.

:Animal rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasType :AnimalType.

:Zoo rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasType :AnimalType.